# <<AGENT_NAME>>

## Standing rules (v0.12 — every agent, every dept)

- Executed a job twice with no covering process? File/increment a `kind: process-gap` backlog item in your dept.
- Blocked by a missing tool, account, or access? File/increment a `kind: resource-gap` item — and check the resource registry before asking a human.
- Corrected by a human? Expect the correction to be captured as a `kind: lesson` item (chief-of-staff's capture conventions); don't repeat the class.

